[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Heracles Software Design Document for Internal GUI
UID: DHF-HRC-0033
METADATA:
  COMPONENT: heracles-internal-gui

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @grammar

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Purpose

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The purpose of this document is to outline the design specifications of the Heracles Internal GUI Software.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document describes the design modules and sub-modules of the Heracles Internal GUI Software.

The information in this document is derived from the Internal GUI SRS, referenced in this document.

\*The term Software applies to both Software and Firmware components.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Abbreviations and Definitions

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
FW
Firmware

MCU
Microcontroller Unit

PRS
Product Requirements Specification

SDP
Software Development Plan

SRS
Software Requirements Specification

SVP
Software Verification Plan

SW
Software
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Overview

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The Internal GUI SW provides a means for the user to maintain demographic patient data, including treatment plans. It communicates with the record and verify component and flange camera stream.

The internal GUI software runs on an industrial PC located at the base of the system
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: References

