[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-680
TITLE: New Collimator Mandatory Fields
STATEMENT: >>>
The Mandatory field of a Collimator should be:

- Serial - Automatically identified from telemetry.

- Type, Energy, and SSD should be fetched/saved from the Configuration Table.

Collimator Table

+----------------------------+---------+------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| Name                       | Type    | constraint | Description                                   |
+============================+=========+============+===============================================+
| ID                         | Int64   | Not Null   | Primary key. Auto incremental                 |
+----------------------------+---------+------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| HeadID                     | Int64   | Not Null   | Foreign Key to Head table                     |
+----------------------------+---------+------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| CollimatorConfigurati onID | Int64   | Not Null   | Foreign Key to CollimatorConfigurati on table |
+----------------------------+---------+------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| CreateDate                 | Date    | Not Null   |                                               |
+----------------------------+---------+------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| Serial                     | String  | Not Null   | Unique                                        |
+----------------------------+---------+------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| IsActive                   | Tinyint | Not Null   |                                               |
+----------------------------+---------+------------+-----------------------------------------------+

CollimatorConfiguration Table

+--------------------+----------------+------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| Name               | Type           | constraint | Description                                                    |
+====================+================+============+================================================================+
| ID                 | Int64          |            |                                                                |
+--------------------+----------------+------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| CreateDate         | DateTime       | Not Null   |                                                                |
+--------------------+----------------+------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| Type               | TargetTypeEnum | Not Null   | Unique with Energy and SSD                                     |
+--------------------+----------------+------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| Energy             | Energy Enum    | Not Null   | Unique with Type and SSD                                       |
+--------------------+----------------+------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| SSD                | SSDType Enum   | Not Null   | Unique with Type and Energy                                    |
+--------------------+----------------+------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| ReferencedDoseRate | Decimal        |            | Dose rate in the a specific cell in the collimator that serves |
+--------------------+----------------+------------+----------------------------------------------------------------+


<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-321
  ROLE: Refines

