[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-682
TITLE: Emission Current Calculation
STATEMENT: >>>
The Current should be auto-calculated as the quotient of Power[W] divided by Energy Level[kV]:

Emission Current[mA] = Power[W] / Voltage[kV]

The device shall operate at a constant power of 50W.

Here are the calculated values as a dependency on Energy Level:

+----------+-------------+----------------------+
| Power[W] | Voltage[kV] | Emission Current[mA] |
+==========+=============+======================+
| 50       | 50          | 1                    |
+----------+-------------+----------------------+
| 50       | 70          | 0.71                 |
+----------+-------------+----------------------+
| 50       | 100         | 0.5                  |
+----------+-------------+----------------------+
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-232
  ROLE: Refines

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-683
TITLE: Calculate Emission Duration
STATEMENT: >>>
The Field Actual Dose should be auto-calculate from the duration using the following function:

[Field Output factor] * [Dose Rate cGy/min] * Duration / 60

i.e. 1.05 * 320 * 18 / 60 = 100.8 cGy

Field Output factor - This value should be retrieved from the OutputFactor service.

Dose Rate - This value should be retrieved from the CollimatorConfiguration Service.

Duration - This value is calculated from the [PrescribedDose] / ([FieldOutputFactor] * [DoseRate]) * 60
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-231
  ROLE: Refines

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-684
TITLE: Alert for an Invalid Plan when there are changes that affect its validity.
STATEMENT: >>>
The alert for an Invalid Plan will be triggered according to the following sequence diagram:

.. raw:: html

   <pre class="mermaid">
   sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Actor
    participant PrescriptionView
    participant PrescriptionViewModel

    A->>PrescriptionView: SavePrescription
    activate PrescriptionView
    
    PrescriptionView->>PrescriptionViewModel: SavePrescriptionAsync
    activate PrescriptionViewModel
    
    PrescriptionViewModel->>PrescriptionViewModel: CheckIfChangeAffectPlan
    activate PrescriptionViewModel
    deactivate PrescriptionViewModel
    
    PrescriptionViewModel->>PrescriptionViewModel: ShowMessageForUser (Plan will be delted)
    activate PrescriptionViewModel
    deactivate PrescriptionViewModel
    
    deactivate PrescriptionViewModel
    deactivate PrescriptionView
   </pre>
<<<
