[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-708
TITLE: Display System Telemetry
STATEMENT: >>>
The receive-only GCB telemetry service passes unsolicited device-information, telemetry,
and fault datagrams to the system telemetry processor. Device information selects the
normal or calibration parser. Valid packets become immutable semantic snapshots and are
published through the main-board model and GCB data store; unsupported versions or
malformed packets do not replace the last valid snapshot. Publication is limited to one
snapshot every 250 ms, and 1.5 seconds without valid telemetry produces an unavailable
snapshot.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-54
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-65
  ROLE: Refines

