[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-713
TITLE: Retrieve System Signals
STATEMENT: >>>
The detailed telemetry view binds to nullable semantic fields on the GCB data store's
latest immutable telemetry snapshot and renders unavailable firmware-specific fields as
not available. The fault view binds to the store's latched active-fault list and displays
each formatted message with its captured state and runtime. Both views consume store
notifications and do not poll the firmware.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-65
  ROLE: Refines

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10SG-714
TITLE: Calibration Mode Patient Lockout
STATEMENT: >>>
The indoor main-tabs view binds the Patients tab enabled state to the immutable telemetry
firmware mode. Calibration mode disables the tab. A high-z-order overlay inside the tab
obscures previously rendered patient content and displays the service-required message.
Unknown or unavailable firmware mode does not lock the tab.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10SG-741
  ROLE: Refines

